# Continuous Closure System (permanent)

Authority: `docs/CONTINUOUS_CLOSURE_SYSTEM.md` + `agent_policy.yaml` `continuous_closure` block.

## Every session / Automation tick
1. Run or read `reports/latest/continuous_closure/resume_state.json` (or `python scripts/system3_continuous_closure_orchestrator.py`).
2. Execute **one** `next_id` from auto-resume (test-first in `tests/evals/`). Do not wait for chat approval on routine GitOps.
3. Multi-source verify before claiming DONE: repo + reports + live URL.
4. Update `BACKLOG.md` + re-run orchestrator (appends proof ledger + intent tick); post Issue #188.
5. Keep Overview blocker cards honest; never invent PASS/ρ/prices; LIVE=false.

## Do not
- Skip resume pointer and randomly pick work.
- Mark RESOLVED without live SHA verify when the defect is production-visible.
- Remove autonomous banner before genuine 7/7 gates.
